# Templates and the daily note: C starts a note from templates/, T opens today's note.
Output assets/readme/feature-templates.gif
Source assets/readme/tapes/lib/common.tape

Type "C"
Sleep 1.5s
Down
Sleep 800ms
Enter
Sleep 800ms
Ctrl+U
Type "Sprint planning"
Sleep 1s
Enter
Sleep 2s
Type "T"
Sleep 2.5s

Type "q"
